// Emits contrast.generated.json — WCAG contrast ratios for every literal-hex
// color token in tokens.json against pure white (#FFFFFF, the light-surface
// approximation) and pure black (#000000, the dark-surface approximation).
// Scoped to LITERAL tokens only: the CSS-var-backed surface/text/border
// tokens have no single value (each MFE picks its own RGB triple per theme —
// see emit-tokens-css.mjs's header comment) so there's no fixed pair to rate.
